sequenceDiagram
    title Password reset
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web App
    participant A as Auth API
    participant M as Mail Service

    U->>W: Forgot password
    W->>A: POST /password-resets
    alt email exists
        A-)M: send reset link
        A-->>W: 202 Accepted
    else unknown email
        A-->>W: 202 Accepted (same answer)
    end
    Note over W,A: never reveal whether the email exists
    W-->>U: Check your inbox
